  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1402.54 Substantial completion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.54 “Substantial completion” means that construction of the project, or a discrete part thereof, is sufficiently completed that the project or discrete part can be used for the purposes for which it is intended.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; renumbered by #13289 (formerly Env-Dw 1402.52); ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
